The fork point is upstream commit 86b6dee ("use EGL for headless GPU rendering in libero example", PR #837).

Modifications by the IMLE-VLA authors (Apache-2.0):
  - src/openpi/models/pi0.py, pi0_config.py: conditional IMLE (cIMLE) training objective and
    single-step action sampling for pi0 / pi0.5.
  - scripts/train.py, src/openpi/training/config.py: IMLE metrics, training configs, resume fast-forward.
  - scripts/serve_policy.py: serving of converted Triton checkpoints through the openpi transform pipeline.
  - examples/: LIBERO execution-horizon flag and timing, direct Triton evaluation, DROID client jerk metric.
  - realtime-vla-imle/: single-step Triton inference engine.

